[CENTER][IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraChat/assets/banner.png[/IMG]

[SIZE=5][B]Formatting, channels & moderation for your chat.[/B][/SIZE]

UltraChat takes over the entire chat: formats per rank, channels, private messages and a filter against spam, caps and advertising.
UltraChat is part of the [B][COLOR=#8B5CF6]Ultra[/COLOR][COLOR=#22D3EE]Plugins[/COLOR][/B] series: every plugin shares the same colours, the same message layout and the same command structure.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-features.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*]MiniMessage formats per rank with hover and click actions
[*]Channels: global, local, staff and custom ones
[*]Private messages with /msg and /r, social spy for staff
[*]Filter against swearing, spam, caps and advertising
[*]Mentions with sound, [item] to show items
[*]Clear chat, mute chat and slow mode
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-layout.png[/IMG]

No chat spam. Every confirmation, countdown and status appears in the [B]action bar[/B].
Only [B][COLOR=#F87171]errors[/COLOR][/B] are sent to the chat, so players never miss them.
All messages use MiniMessage and can be changed in [FONT=Courier New]messages.yml[/FONT].

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraChat/assets/preview.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-commands.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/msg <spieler> <text> · /r <text>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Private messages [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrachat.msg)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/channel [name][/COLOR][/FONT] – Switch channel [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrachat.channel)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/chatclear[/COLOR][/FONT] – Clear the chat [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrachat.clear)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/mutechat[/COLOR][/FONT] – Lock / unlock the chat [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrachat.mutechat)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/slowmode <sekunden>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Set slow mode [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrachat.slowmode)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/socialspy[/COLOR][/FONT] – Read private messages [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrachat.socialspy)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/ultrachat <help|reload|version>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Administration [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrachat.admin)[/COLOR]
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-permissions.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrachat.color[/FONT] – Use colours in chat
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrachat.bypass.filter[/FONT] – Bypass the filter
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrachat.*[/FONT] – Everything
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-installation.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST=1]
[*]Download UltraChat and drop the jar into your [FONT=Courier New]plugins[/FONT] folder.
[*]Restart your server.
[*]Adjust [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT] and [FONT=Courier New]messages.yml[/FONT], then run [FONT=Courier New]/ultrachat reload[/FONT].
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-series.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][B]UltraSpawn[/B] – Spawn management done right.
[*][B]UltraTeleports[/B] – Requests, random teleport & back in one plugin.
[*][B]UltraPunish[/B] – Clean moderation with GUI, templates & history.
[*][B]UltraHomes[/B] – Set, manage and share homes in one GUI.
[*][B]UltraWarps[/B] – Server & player warps with categories.
[*][B]UltraEconomy[/B] – Fast, Vault-ready economy with multiple currencies.
[*][B]UltraKits[/B] – Kits with previews, cooldowns & in-game editor.
[*][B]UltraVanish[/B] – True invisibility for your staff team.
[*][B]UltraReports[/B] – Player reports with a staff GUI workflow.
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-support.png[/IMG]

Found a bug or have an idea? Please use the discussion tab or send a private message instead of leaving a bad review. We answer every request.[/CENTER]
